<ltml units="in" margin="1">
  <layout id="vbox" vpadding="6pt" />

  <page layout="vbox">
    <style>
      p { font.color: blue; }
    </style>

    <label font.size="18" font.weight="Bold">Contents</label>

    <index id="main_toc">
      <p><index-title font.weight="Bold" /><index-leader /><span font.color="red"><index-page /></span></p>
    </index>

    <p>Fee</p>
    <p>Fie</p>
    <p>Foe</p>
    <p>Fum</p>

    <p align="bottom" style.text-align="center"><pageno hidden="true" reset="1" /></p>
  </page>

  <page layout="vbox">
    <label id="intro" font.size="16" font.weight="Bold">Introduction</label>
    <index_entry index="main_toc" target="intro">Introduction</index_entry>
    <p>Leadtype can now collect explicit index entries and resolve them into a table of contents after layout stabilizes.</p>
    <p align="bottom" style.text-align="center"><pageno /></p>
  </page>

  <page layout="vbox">
    <target id="appendix_a" />
    <label font.size="16" font.weight="Bold">Appendix A</label>
    <index_entry index="main_toc" target="appendix_a">Appendix A</index_entry>
    <p>This page demonstrates an explicit target element that does not render visible content on the destination page.</p>
    <p align="bottom" style.text-align="center"><pageno /></p>
  </page>

</ltml>
